@@ -640,6 +644,14 @@ c.tool_offset(toolno, z_offset,  x_offset, diameter, frontangle, backangle, orie
 `abort()`::
   send EMC_TASK_ABORT message.
 
+`program_stop()`::
+  stop an active AUTO program without clearing its interpreter or motion
+  queues. The program can be continued with Run, Resume, or Single Step.
+  Position-synchronized motion (`G33`, `G33.1`) and a queued `G28.2` homing
+  cycle run to completion before the program holds.
+  The command is rejected when no AUTO program is active; use `abort()` when
+  execution must be terminated.
+
 `auto(int[, int])`::
   run, step, pause or resume a program.
 
